q8: "Geen IDictionary / IReadOnlyDictionary?" {shape: diamond}
m8: "Manual: Dictionary: check whether Count or Keys is meant\n(proof: dictionary)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
s: "Welk lid geeft het aantal?" {shape: diamond}
f1: "Fixed: x.Length.<Should>(n)\n(proof: array)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
f2: "Fixed: x.Count.<Should>(n[, because]); haakjes en ShouldNotBeNull() via NotNullReceiver\n(proof: list, list-because, collection-interfaces, receiver-parens, nullable, count-comparisons)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
f3: "Fixed: x.Count().<Should>(n) + using System.Linq\n(proof: enumerable, enumerable-because, enumerable-existing-using)" {style.fill: "#c8e6c9"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
mx1: "Manual: Non-generic IEnumerable: use Cast<T>().Count()\n(geen proof)" {style.fill: "#ffe0b2"; style.font-color: "#000000"; style.border-radius: 12}
